# Running the test suite imports set-version.py, which byte-compiles it.
#
# Kept next to the scripts rather than in the root .gitignore so it travels
# with them, and because everything under .github/ is .fernignore'd, which
# makes it safe from regeneration by construction. (The root .gitignore looks
# safe too — the generator neither emits nor deletes it, and the manual #46
# survived the #48 and #49 regenerations untouched — but it carries no
# .fernignore entry guaranteeing that.)
__pycache__/
